flowchart TD
  X["1. API presents its X.509 server certificate during TLS<br/>Hostname, server public key and validity dates<br/>API also sends any needed intermediate certificates"]
  V["2. Client validates the X.509 certificate<br/>Trusted CA chain, hostname, validity dates and proof of private-key control"]
  T["3. Client sends the bearer JWT over the established TLS connection"]
  J["4. API verifies the JWT with the issuer's trusted JWT signing public key"]
  X --> V --> T --> J
  style X fill:#e9f0ff,stroke:#2563eb,stroke-width:2px
  style V fill:#f2f6ff,stroke:#2563eb
  style T fill:#eef8f0,stroke:#16a34a
  style J fill:#fcf5ea,stroke:#d97706
